		(property "Description" "Right-angle 2x15 header on the bottom edge (the slot pinout, docs/hardware/accessory_ports.md). Used: 5 V, GND, CAN, switched 12 V (8), constant 12 V (10), WAKE (12). Not used: the slot 3.3 V (the card makes its own), slot ID (the node is fixed), LAMP, REV, I2S, audio, AUX 12 V"
